    {
      "id": "claim_a232d89f4e4a438e96685a304bd42c33",
      "statement": "BaseChatModel implements the Runnable protocol with both imperative (invoke, stream, ainvoke, astream, batch, abatch) and declarative (bind_tools, with_structured_output, with_retry, with_fallbacks) methods, supporting both synchronous and asynchronous execution paths with consistent callback integration.",
